[CHOSEN, not recovered] vkd3d-shader 2.1 patch for the BF2 macOS port (LGPL-2.1+, as vkd3d).
Local common subexpression elimination before sm1-3 register allocation: identical
expressions, swizzles, constants and uniform loads in one block are computed once.
A matrix read through a non-constant array index (skinning: Bones[idx]) otherwise
loads each constant register once per component and exceeds the 12 temporaries of
vs_1_1/vs_2_0 (365 BF2 vertex shaders; one even exceeded vs_3_0's 32).

